			"notes": "## Changelog\n- Config Rework (⚠️Your existing config will be overwritten! Make sure to backup your previous settings⚠️)\n- Added LevelShare config option\n  - \"modeOnPlayerKill\" when the player got killed by another player\n - Added local xp loss message to the affected player when global shaming is disabled\n\n| LevelShareMode             | Description               |\n|---------------------|:---------------------:|\n| DISTRIBUTE | Distribute an equal amount among all current players |\n| TAKE | Gives the xp to the attacking player |\n| LOOSE | Like the regular death penalty |"
